#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd-validation.rst:2
msgid "SQD measured results"
msgstr "SQD 实测结果"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd-validation.rst:4
msgid ""
"These are historical measurements from the SQD delivery. They are not accuracy or memory "
"guarantees for new calculations. The measured environment used Linux x86_64, Python 3.12.3, NumPy"
" 2.4.1, SciPy 1.16.3, ffsim 0.0.84, Qiskit 2.5.2, and qiskit-addon-sqd 0.13.1."
msgstr ""
"这些是 SQD 交付时的历史测量，不保证新计算的精度或内存。测量环境为 Linux x86_64、Python 3.12.3、NumPy 2.4.1、SciPy 1.16.3、ffsim "
"0.0.84、Qiskit 2.5.2 和 qiskit-addon-sqd 0.13.1。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd-validation.rst:9
msgid ""
"The approved default benchmark scope used reps 2/shots 100000. All eight runs used T0, and their "
"measured whole-process-tree peaks were below 2 billion bytes (maximum 1,021,018,112 bytes). "
"Sampling alone peaked at 732,467,200 bytes. Measurements used 10 ms polling and do not guarantee "
"capture of every instantaneous peak or certify arbitrary geometries, MM systems, plugins or T2 "
"paths."
msgstr ""
"获准的默认基准范围使用重复数 2、采样数 100000。全部八次运行使用 T0，实测完整进程树峰值均低于 20 亿字节（最高 1,021,018,112 字节）。仅采样阶段的峰值为 "
"732,467,200 字节。测量使用 10 ms 轮询，不能保证捕获每个瞬时峰值，也不认证任意几何、MM 体系、插件或 T2 路径。"

