#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd-validation.rst:40
msgid ""
"These deltas use each run's own Hamiltonian/frame/core reference. Historical absolute energies "
"must not be mixed into them. The calibration rejected historical glycine runs with reps 4/shots "
"200000. It also rejected N₂ runs with reps 4/shots 500000. Their energy and full-run memory "
"benchmarks remain unmeasured. Rejecting a run before execution does not constitute a successful "
"memory benchmark."
msgstr ""
"这些差值使用各次运行自身的哈密顿量、框架和芯常数参考。不得混入历史绝对能量。校准模型拒绝了 reps 4/shots 200000 的历史甘氨酸运行。它也拒绝了 reps 4/shots "
"500000 的 N₂ 运行。它们的能量和完整运行内存仍未测量。执行前拒绝运行，不等于通过内存基准。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd-validation.rst:46
msgid ""
"E1 (four orbital bases) and E6 (restricted connectivity) remain **inconclusive** because their "
"original numerical matrices exceed the certified domain. E1 requires all per-seed and mean ranges"
" to lie strictly on one side of 2 mHa for a directional conclusion. Missing points cannot pass. "
"E6 compares restricted-minus-full errors per seed against 5 mHa. Missing points or threshold "
"crossings are inconclusive."
msgstr ""
"E1（四种轨道基底）和 E6（受限连通性）仍然**无定论**，因为其原始数值矩阵超出认证域。E1 要求所有单种子和均值范围均严格位于 2 mHa "
"的同一侧，才能得出方向性结论。缺失点不能通过。E6 将每个种子的受限减完整误差与 5 mHa 比较。缺失点或跨越阈值均无定论。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd-validation.rst:53
msgid ""
"H₃O⁺ checks show that the operator uses the supplied connectivity. They do not establish better "
"energies or hardware readiness. The checks do not certify hardware layout, SWAP overhead, noise, "
"or ancillas. The delivery did not run E3. Its status remains ``not_run``."
msgstr "H₃O⁺ 检查表明算符使用了传入的连通性。它们不证明能量更优或硬件就绪。这些检查不认证硬件布局、SWAP 开销、噪声或辅助比特。交付未运行 E3，其状态保持 ``not_run``。"

