#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd-validation.rst:74
msgid ""
"The :doc:`/tutorials/sqd-showcase` identifies the maintained example commands. Historical reports"
" under ``tmp/`` and evidence under ``.plan/`` are not installed package assets. Retain the "
"original reports when citing these historical measurements."
msgstr ""
":doc:`/tutorials/sqd-showcase` 列出维护中的示例命令。``tmp/`` 中的历史报告和 ``.plan/`` "
"中的证据不属于安装包资源。引用这些历史测量时，保留原始报告。"
